    return PermissionDenied
}
```

#### 3k. SSE Hub `canReceive` -- `/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/sse_hub.go`, lines 134-144

Controls which connected SSE clients receive real-time events based on memo visibility:
```go
func (c *SSEClient) canReceive(event *SSEEvent) bool {
    switch event.Visibility {
    case store.Private:
        return c.userID == event.CreatorID || c.role == store.RoleAdmin
    case store.Public, store.Protected, "":
        return true
    default:
        return false
    }
}
```
Called at line 123 in `Broadcast`. This means PRIVATE memo events are only delivered to the memo creator or admin.

