    return nil, status.Errorf(codes.NotFound, "not found")
}
```

#### 3s. ACL Configuration -- `/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/acl_config.go`

Defines which API endpoints are publicly accessible (no auth required). The comment at line 32 explicitly states: `Memo Service - public memos (visibility filtering done in service layer)`. Endpoints `GetMemo`, `ListMemos`, `ListMemoComments`, `GetMemoByShare` are public-access (line 33-41), relying on the service-layer visibility checks documented above.

