**`isSuperUser`** -- `/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/common.go`, line 77:
```go
func isSuperUser(user *store.User) bool {
    return user.Role == store.RoleAdmin
}
```
Admin users bypass PRIVATE restrictions in most checks.

